      "message": "I revisited all assertions in this test. However, IMHO we should not check the exact size of the traceIds collection in every test. In general we now support multiple traceIds per request and each test case shall concentrate on its own aspect. For example if an explict traceId is assigned to a request then it has to be included in the traceIds collection but we don\u0027t check for any other traceId also included in that collection. This makes tests more stable if we change some policies how traceID(s) are added to requests.",
